    <string name="about_privacy_text">Lantern is made by %1$s and collects nothing about you. It has no internet permission, so it sends nothing anywhere: no accounts, no ads, no analytics. Your tasks and settings stay on this phone. Backups go only to the folder you pick. Crash reports stay on the phone, and in your backups, until you copy one yourself.</string>
