    <string name="whats_new_10001">• Goals are here! Set a goal in six short steps, then pin it to the wall.\n• A goal\'s weekly actions show up on Today and fill in with one tick.\n• Your why is always on the goal\'s note; hold a note to read it again.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new</string>
    <string name="whats_new_ok">Got it</string>
    <string name="whats_new_908">• A cleaner release build: no camera access, smaller.\n• «Erase everything» in Settings: start over; your backups stay where they are.\n• Your data opens from every older version, and old backups restore too.\n• If the app ever closes by itself, the report is in «About». Tap «Copy» and send it to us. Nothing is sent on its own.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_909">• Settings now checks Bazaar for a new version, with one tap to update.\n• «Erase everything» in Settings: start over; your backups stay where they are.\n• Your data opens from every older version, and old backups restore too.\n• No camera access any more.\n• If the app ever closes by itself, the report is in «About». Tap «Copy» and send it to us. Nothing is sent on its own.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_910">• «About» now has a privacy note: nothing leaves your phone.\n• «Licenses» lists the font and the open-source parts Lantern is built with.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_911">• The companions talk in a new voice, and the knight has a new name.\n• Their lines on Today are shorter; the «Now» card shows what to do next.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_912">• «About» now has a way to contact the developer.\n• Phone setup now covers Samsung and Huawei/Honor too, not only Xiaomi.\n• «Getting reminders» says where to tap: search for Lantern\'s name, and set the battery to “No restrictions”.</string>
    <string name="whats_new_10000">• A new splash: a castle under the moon.\n• A new icon: the knight\'s sword.</string>
    <string name="rate_title">Is Lantern helping?</string>
